# Browser support matrix.
#
# Vite/esbuild use this to decide which transforms to apply.
# Tighter than `defaults` so we ship modern syntax to modern
# browsers and a lighter polyfill payload.
#
# Coverage:
#   - Chrome / Edge: last 2 major versions
#   - Firefox: last 2 major versions
#   - Safari iOS: 14+ (covers iPhone 6s and later)
#   - Safari macOS: 14+
#   - Android Chrome: last 2 versions
#   - WebView Android: last 2 versions
#
# Anything older falls outside support — show a "your browser is too
# old" notice on landing rather than ship broken JS.

defaults
not dead
not IE 11
not op_mini all
not Baidu > 0
last 2 Chrome versions
last 2 Edge versions
last 2 Firefox versions
last 2 Safari versions
iOS >= 14
last 2 ChromeAndroid versions
